Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0), debootstrap, lxc, jq,
         python3-fpdf2
Description: Maigret identity/username OSINT collector (LXC-sandboxed)
 Wraps the Maigret CLI OSINT tool inside a dedicated debootstrap/LXC
 sandbox. Given a username, Maigret searches 3000+ sites for matching
 accounts and produces a dossier. Features include:
  - Username / identity account discovery across 3000+ sites
  - Passive-only collection (no active probing of the target)
  - Sandboxed execution in a dedicated LXC container
  - JWT-gated REST API with append-only audit logging
  - Detached worker model (never blocks the aggregator loop)
